{"id":29544,"slug":"police-story","title":"Police Story","year":1985,"country":"Hong Kong","duration":100,"spine":971,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29544-police-story","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/cd4ae6bdbaea9fd9c9aff1d69f924bc4/5wErYoFwVfkciAfnpRbFIhPqv7tIC5_large.jpg","description":"The jaw-dropping set pieces fly fast and furious in Jackie Chan’s breathtakingly inventive martial-arts comedy, a smash hit that made him a worldwide icon of daredevil action spectacle. The director/star/one-man stunt machine plays Ka-Kui, a Hong Kong police inspector who goes rogue to bring down a drug kingpin and protect the case’s star witness (Chinese cinema legend Brigitte Lin) from retribution. Packed wall-to-wall with charmingly goofball slapstick and astoundingly acrobatic fight choreography—including an epic shopping-mall melee of flying fists and shattered glass—Police Story set a new standard for rock-’em-sock-’em mayhem that would influence a generation of filmmakers from Hong Kong to Hollywood.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jackie Chan","slug":"jackie-chan"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jackie Chan","role":"Chan Ka-kui","slug":"jackie-chan"},{"actor":"Brigitte Lin","role":"Salina Fong","slug":"brigitte-lin"},{"actor":"Maggie Cheung","role":"May","slug":"maggie-cheung"},{"actor":"Chor Yuen","role":"Chu","slug":"chor-yuen"},{"actor":"Bill Tung","role":"Bill","slug":"bill-tung"},{"actor":"Ken Tong","role":"Tak","slug":"ken-tong"},{"actor":"Lam Kwok-Hung","role":"Superintendent Raymond Li","slug":"lam-kwok-hung"},{"actor":"Lau Chi-Wing","role":"Counselor","slug":"lau-chi-wing"},{"actor":"Charlie Cho","role":"John Ko","slug":"charlie-cho"},{"actor":"Kam Hing-Yin","role":"Inspector man","slug":"kam-hing-yin"},{"actor":"Mars","role":"Kim","slug":"mars"},{"actor":"Fung Hak-on","role":"Danny Chu","slug":"fung-hak-on"},{"actor":"Wan Fat","role":"Mad Wing","slug":"wan-fat"},{"actor":"Tai Bo","role":"Snake Eyes","slug":"tai-bo"}],"credit